---
import App from '../layouts/App.astro';
import ActivityTable from '../components/ActivityTable.astro';
import { SPLIT_SCENE } from '../data/scene-labels';
import { txUrl } from '../data/testnet';
import { PROJECT_NAME } from '../consts';
---
<App area="overview" title="Overview" intro="The registry statement since mint and what needs attention, read live from NEAR with view calls.">
  <section class="panel start" aria-labelledby="start-h">
    <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="start-h">Start here</h2></div>
    <ol class="panel-body start-list">
      <li><strong>What is {PROJECT_NAME}.</strong> {PROJECT_NAME} is a registry of music rights shares on NEAR. Each share of a song is minted as an NEP-171 NFT, and minting it also creates a payout account on NEAR that has no keys. Payments for a song arrive at the registry, which splits them between its shares by their recorded percentages and credits each share's account. Only the account that holds the share NFT can collect that money, so selling the NFT moves the right to be paid with it.</li>
      <li><strong>Try it in one click.</strong> <a class="link" href="/share?id=s15">Open share s15</a> to see a split sheet that every writer must approve before money can move. While it is pending, the share's money is held, and once every writer approves, the money is released to the share's account.</li>
      <li><strong>What is Simulated.</strong> The payer is a test account and the payment agent is scripted. The share NFTs, their keyless accounts and every transaction are real records on chain.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="stmt-h" class="stack">
    <div class="row-head"><h2 id="stmt-h">Statement since mint</h2><span class="caption">Totals for every share account combined</span></div>
    <div class="figures kpi" data-statement><p class="loading figure">Reading testnet</p></div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="tot-h" class="stack">
    <h2 id="tot-h" class="sr">Totals</h2>
    <div class="figures kpi minor" data-counts></div>
  </section>
  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="split-h" data-split-scene>
    <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="split-h">Split sheet scene, work {SPLIT_SCENE.workId}</h2><span class="caption">{SPLIT_SCENE.workCode}. NEAR does: holds the pending half in escrow, then releases it when the registrant signs.</span></div>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="ledger rows-sm">
      <thead><tr><th>Share</th><th>Holder</th><th>Share of work</th><th>Approval</th><th class="num">In vault, mUSDC</th><th class="num">Held in escrow, mUSDC</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody data-split-rows><tr><td colspan="6" class="loading">Reading testnet</td></tr></tbody>
    </table></div>
    <ol class="panel-body split-steps">
      {SPLIT_SCENE.steps.map((st) => <li>{st.label}. {st.txs.map((h) => <a class="acct-link tx" href={txUrl(h)} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{h.slice(0, 8)}</a>)}</li>)}
    </ol>
  </section>
  <div class="ov-grid">
    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="att-h">
      <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="att-h">Needs attention</h2></div>
      <ul class="todo" data-attention><li class="loading">Reading testnet</li></ul>
    </section>
    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="act-h">
      <div class="panel-head"><h2 id="act-h">Latest activity</h2><div class="end"><a class="btn sm" href="/auction">Auction</a><a class="btn sm" href="/activity">All activity</a></div></div>
      <ActivityTable id="ov-acts" limit={5} />
    </section>
  </div>
</App>
<script>import '../scripts/overview.ts';</script>
<style is:global>
  .start-list { margin: 0; padding-left: var(--s7, 2rem); display: grid; gap: var(--s2); }
  .split-steps { margin: 0; padding-left: var(--s7, 2rem); display: grid; gap: var(--s2); }
  .split-steps .acct-link.tx { margin-left: .5rem; }
  .row-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: var(--s4); flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .figures.minor .figure .value { font-size: var(--fs-22); }
  .ov-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--s5); align-items: start; }
  .todo { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .todo li { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .todo li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .todo li.loading { padding: var(--s4) var(--s5); }
  .todo a { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: .1rem var(--s3); align-items: center; min-height: 3.5rem; padding: var(--s3) var(--s5); text-decoration: none; }
  .todo a:hover { background: var(--surface-2); }
  .todo .t { font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--fs-14); }
  .todo .d { grid-column: 1; font-size: var(--fs-12); color: var(--muted); }
  .todo .badge { grid-row: 1 / span 2; grid-column: 2; }
  @media (max-width: 1199px) { .ov-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .todo a { padding: var(--s3) var(--s4); } }
</style>
